{"id":"drama-orchestrator","i":0,"run":{"i":0,"reply":"项目建好啦，Mino 已经把它放进工作区。去干活的过程很顺，汇报一下战利品：\n\n**项目：《复仇打脸》**（目录：`复仇打脸短剧/`）\n- 题材：复仇打脸\n- 集数：60 集\n- 画幅：竖屏 9:16\n- 说明语言：中文\n- 状态：已初始化，目录骨架就位（`剧集/`、`设定集/`、`项目开发/`、`创作者决策/` 等）\n\n按现在的规范，我不会预先塞一堆空文件进去——每集真正开写时才生成 `剧本.md`、`视觉设定.md`、`分镜.md`、`图片提示词.md`、`视频提示词.md`，用到哪份建哪份。\n\n还差两个可选设定，没定也不影响开工：单集目标时长（比如 60 秒 / 90 秒）、以及是否指定目标视频模型。\n\n下一步你想先来哪个？\n1. **先做开发**：把「复仇打脸」拉成故事主线 + 人物 + 60 集分集地图（推荐，60 集不先规划容易散）\n2. **直接写 EP001 剧本**：我先给你一集开个头看手感\n3. 先定单集时长 / 画风（制作形态），再往下走\n\n你说一声，我就接着去觅食～","tools":171,"toolNames":["astron_skillhub_check_availability","astron_skillhub_check_update","astron_skillhub_disable","astron_skillhub_enable","astron_skillhub_install","astron_skillhub_list_installed","astron_skillhub_operation","astron_skillhub_search","astron_skillhub_uninstall","astron_skillhub_upgrade","bili_comments","bili_config","bili_cover","bili_frames","bili_humanism_cancel","bili_humanism_candidates","bili_humanism_frames","bili_humanism_guide","bili_humanism_import","bili_humanism_inbox","bili_humanism_journal","bili_humanism_memory","bili_humanism_personality","bili_humanism_probe","bili_humanism_question","bili_humanism_read","bili_humanism_source","bili_humanism_status","bili_humanism_visual","bili_live_asr_probe","bili_live_audio_start","bili_live_audio_status","bili_live_audio_stop","bili_live_doctor","bili_live_feed","bili_live_info","bili_live_log","bili_live_request","bili_live_send","bili_live_transcript","bili_live_watch_start","bili_live_watch_status","bili_live_watch_stop","bili_live_watching","bili_login_poll","bili_login_start","bili_reply","bili_run","bili_search","bili_setup","bili_status","bili_subtitle","bili_whoami","desktop_control","desktop_sequence","drawio_render","drawio_template","drawio_validate","dsh_im_group_file","dsh_im_group_history","dsh_im_return_file","edit","edit_image","generate_image","generate_images","glob","grep","import_chat","learn_meme","list_mcp_resource_templates","list_mcp_resources","mcp__c